      203.09,
      397.19,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(b)the study and promotion of the Islamic religionand culture and the inculcation of the principles ofservice of the community and the country throughits teachings;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      264.65,
      397.15,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "(c)the teaching of Quran and traditions of ProphetMohamed (P.B.U.H.) to the Muslims;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      301.49,
      397.18,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "(d)the collection of Zakath (Wealth Tax Obligation ofMuslims) to distribute among the Muslims to fulfilltheir economic needs;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      350.69,
      397.19,
      374.39
    ],
