    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      387.65,
      397.18,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "(f)the establishment of a Counseling Centre to solvethe problems among Muslims according to theteachings according to the teachings of Islam;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      436.85,
      397.17,
      485.03
    ],
    "text": "(g)the establishment of a Comprehensive Library andthe translation of rare and important books toSinhala and Tamil; or any other language asnecessary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      498.29,
      397.18,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "(h)the establishment of a well equipped Institution totrain students and teachers of Arabic Colleges to bequalified in Information Technology;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      547.49,
      397.17,
      571.19
    ],
    "text": "(i)the collection of funds and other donations for theaforesaid purposes;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      584.45,
      397.18,
      620.39
    ],
    "text": "(j)the use and application of the said funds to grantscholarships to provide career guidance andenhance educational; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      633.65,
      397.2,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(k)to do all such other acts and things as are necessary,conducive or incidental to the attainment of all orany of the objects of the Foundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
