    "text": "8.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation existingon the day preceding the date of the commencement of thisAct, shall be paid by the Corporation hereby constitutedand all debts due to subscription and contribution payableto the Foundation on that day shall be paid to the Corporationfor the purpose of this Act.",
