    "text": "10.The Corporation shall be able and capable in law toacquire and hold any property, movable and immovablewhich may become vested in it by virtue of any purchase,grant, gift, testamentary disposition or otherwise and all suchproperty shall be held by the Corporation for the purpose ofthis Act, and subject to the rules in force for the time being ofthe Corporation, with full power to sell, mortgage, lease,exchange or otherwise dispose of the same.",
